<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Harveys says still in talks.</title>
<headline>Harveys says still in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harveys Curnow Ltd said on Tuesday the talks referred to in a cautionary dated November 4 were still in progress and which, if successfully concluded, could affect its share price.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
